  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of Infrastructure Projects in the Bekaa region, Lebanon / Lot no 1: water projects</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">oConstruction of storm water canals in Mekse village,oConstruction of a rural bridge in Sohmor village in order to connect the two parts of the Union that face seasonal flood of the Litani River;oInstallation of transmission and distribution lines from the existing well to the new reservoir, and replacement of the existing pump in Niha village;oEstablishment of water supply system in Ain Bourdai and Douris villages ;oDigging a new well in Temnine el Tahta village to serve Temnine el Tah</narrative>
  </description>
